@host = http://localhost:5273/api/v1

### 1. Register an account (14-day free trial starts now)
POST {{host}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Cuenta de Prueba",
  "email": "cuenta.prueba@example.com",
  "password": "Prueba1234",
  "businessName": "Bodega de Prueba",
  "businessType": "PRODUCER",
  "preferredPlanCode": "PROFESSIONAL"
}

### 2. Sign in: copy the "token" of the response
POST {{host}}/tokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cuenta.prueba@example.com",
  "password": "Prueba1234"
}

### 3. Protected endpoint: replace TOKEN and the tenant id (the "id" of the account)
GET {{host}}/tenants/1/products
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 4. Without a token the API answers 401
GET {{host}}/tenants/1/products
